                    <p class="cause-desc">Empowering 120 young artisans, solar technicians, and women tailors with 100% interest-free micro-seed grants.</p>
                    
                    <div class="cause-financials">
                        <div class="progress-bar-container">
                            <div class="progress-bar-fill" style="width: 78%;"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="funding-meta">
                            <span class="amount-raised">PKR 5,460,000</span>
                            <span class="amount-target">Goal: PKR 7,000,000</span>
                        </div>
