                <p class="testimonial-quote">"The onboarding verification was thorough, which gives our donors absolute confidence. GiveAID's NGO portal makes updating project milestones and receipts simple."</p>
                <div class="author-info">
                    <div class="author-avatar">🏥</div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="author-name">Dr. M. Farooq</div>
                        <div class="author-role">Director, Rural Health Clinic Trust</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


